[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:119. A True Story]
[00:00.600]Lesson 119|第119课
[00:03.435]Do you like stories?|你喜欢故事吗？
[00:06.300]I want to tell you a true story.|我想给你讲一个真实的故事。
[00:09.210]It happened to a friend of mine a year ago.|那是在一年前发生在我一位朋友身上的。
[00:13.605]While my friend George was reading in bed,|当我的朋友乔治在床上看书时，
[00:18.015]two thieves climbed into his kitchen.|两个小偷爬进了他的厨房。
[00:22.135]After they had entered the house,|他们进屋后，
[00:25.420]they went into the dining room.|他们走进了餐厅。
[00:28.100]It was very dark,|那里很黑，
[00:30.315]so they turned on a torch.|所以他们打开了一支手电筒。
[00:33.080]Suddenly, they heard a voice behind them.|突然，他们身后传来一个声音。
[00:37.440]What's up? What's up?|怎么了？怎么了？
[00:40.155]Someone called.|有人喊道。
[00:42.345]The thieves dropped the torch and ran away as quickly as they could.|小偷们扔下手电筒，尽可能快地跑走了。
[00:48.120]George heard the noise and came downstairs quickly.|乔治听到声音，迅速下楼。
[00:53.880]He turned on the light, but he couldn't see anyone.|他打开了灯，但什么也没看到。
[00:59.050]The thieves had already gone.|小偷们已经离开了。
[01:02.815]But George's parrot, Henry, was still there.|但乔治的鹦鹉亨利还在那里。
[01:08.320]What's up, George? he called.|怎么了，乔治？它叫道。
[01:12.070]Nothing, Henry, George said and smiled.|没什么，亨利，乔治笑着说。
[01:16.650]Go back to sleep.|回去睡觉吧。